      "context": "grain_silo_discharge_hopper",
      "prompt": "A conical discharge hopper has an upper radius of 14 m, a lower discharge radius of 6 m, and a vertical height of 15 m. Determine the slant height $s = \\sqrt{h^2 + (R - r)^2}$ in exact simplified form.",
